  "notes": "The current MikuAPI key lists grok-imagine-video-1.5 through GET /v1/models. One authorized 4-second 480p 9:16 image-to-video request succeeded on 2026-08-22. On 2026-08-24, a user-authorized Files API smoke test stopped at the first image upload because POST /v1/files returned HTTP 404; the audio file was not uploaded and no video generation POST occurred. A separate single authorized 1-second 480p 16:9 request verified prompt_generated_voice and local Whisper transcribed 你好. On 2026-08-31, one authorized 15-second 480p 16:9 image-to-video request succeeded without retry: provider output was 15.041667 seconds with H.264/AAC, and the clean delivery was 14.166667 seconds after removing 0.875 seconds of excess tail silence. Local Whisper covered the full confirmed message with similarity 0.7031 and one disclosed near-homophone recognition difference. This verifies the gateway's 15-second single-request duration, not exact long-form speech, multi-segment continuity, user voice cloning, reference_images, reference_audios, or 1080p."
